seg-db86ed4b40a9 = Each <c1/> has a <c2/>, an onset <c3/>, a <c4/> (onset to the start of the release), an onset ramp <c5/> and a release ramp <c6/>. Strength rises linearly over <c7/>, holds, then falls over <c8/>; <c9/> is a step. All the effects scale with that strength. Parameters that do not belong to the kind are refused.

