# c2: format = "nmea"
# c3: tests/fixtures/nmea_training/
# c4: KSHANA_BLESS_GOLDEN=1
seg-fbf4002d25cd = <c1/> can ingest these files (<c2/>). The tests check every sentence of every library scenario against its own field-count and checksum rules, and run the files through that reader, which interprets GGA, RMC and GSV and passes over the other types without skipping any. Tests pin a golden excerpt per scenario (<c3/>); regenerate with <c4/> after an intended change.

